    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Dong Kingmafr\nDONG KINGMAN\nMIAMI",
      "Cocktailo\nSherry\nCampari\nNoilly Prat Vermouth\nManhattan\nGin Martini\nVodka Martini Whiskey Sour\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Daiquiri\nTom Collins\nVodka Collins Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian\nGin Vodka\nRum\nPremium Beer\nMenus\nApéritif\nI BU 0049\nSelected Gourmet Delicacies\nRoast au Vol\nA selected cut of aged beef\nroasted on board and carved to order\n** 0-2 t-\u003e\nLamb Curry with Chutney\nChicken Verdi\nTender chicken simmered with capers, olives and celery in a spritely sauce\nSole Belle Meuniere",
      "Chicken Verdi\nTender chicken simmered with capers, olives and celery in a spritely sauce\nSole Belle Meuniere\nPlat du Jour\nSpecialty of the day\nRice Pilaf\nPotatoes Maison\n*i = r\nButtered Vegetable Bouquet\nTossed Garden Salad\nSelection of Fruits and Cheeses\nDessert\nCoffee\n3-E-\nTea\n*I *\nSanka®\n+›* J-E-\nSelected French Wines\nFrench Champagne Brut\nDrambuie\nBénédictine M Crème de Menthe\nCognac Camus Napoléon Cointreau Kahlúa\nAmaretto di Saronno\n146.K.",
      "MIAMI\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting the beautiful,\nthe monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad\nHere he depicts Miami, city of glitter and glamour, of sun and sand, of gleaming highrise hotels and condominiums.\nHost to millions who come for the pleasure of basking amid palms and flowers in this the hub of tropical South Florida\nOne of the most renowned playgrounds in the world, Miami offers a variety of recreation. From golf and tennis to\ndeepsea fishing and yachting. From thoroughbred racing to the \"Son et Lumière\" presentations at exquisite Vizcaya\nMiami also serves as gateway to the Caribbean Cruise World. From here luxury liners offer frequent sailings in\nconjunction with Pan Am's \"Air-Sea\" Flights.\nPan Am jets land at Miami's busy International Airport from all major cities on its US network, from Central and\nSouth America and key European cities such as London, Paris and Frankfurt\nOPAN AM."
    ],
